      "id": 999,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**OCR Detail** - engine `document.v1` (Python): kualitas ekstraksi, latency, antrean, kuota. Platform view: [Services Overview](/d/services-overview).\n\n- Semua seri adalah instrumen `ocr_engine.obs.metrics` - nama panel = nama seri Prometheus.\n- Kriteria pilot go/no-go ada sebagai panel stat (failed %, needs_review %) - threshold merah = batas lulus.\n- Label dibatasi set tetap (method/status/error code/provider); tidak ada document id atau teks OCR di sini."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Proses & provider",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Liveness per proses (api/worker/outbox)",
      "description": "Push telemetry tidak punya `up`: seri ini konstan 1 selama proses hidup. Celah = proses mati; alert `absent()` per ocr_process.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 10,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (ocr_process) (ocr_process_running{service_name=\"ocr\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{ocr_process}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error provider: transient (retry SAQ) vs permanent",
      "description": "Transient = umumnya quota/rate limit Baidu (429) - job di-retry SAQ; permanent = config/token rusak - alarm.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 11,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "rate(ocr_pipeline_transient_errors_total{service_name=\"ocr\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "transient (job retry)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(ocr_provider_errors_total{service_name=\"ocr\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
